<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Lord chose you to be a part</l><l>Of His great plan, His work of art.</l><l>What wonder! What a privilege!</l><l>To satisfy</l><l>His yearning to share all He is—</l><l>Divine, unsearchable riches!</l><l>What wisdom, multifarious expressed!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>As we enjoy and enter in</l><l>To all He is then we’ll begin</l><l>To understand the feeling in</l><l>His heart toward us.</l><l>What love that motivated Him</l><l>To come to us, despite our sin</l><l>Why did He go and sell all that He had?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
